OL,3,ANaomi Campbell wins appeal over charity
OL,4,Aban
OL,5,
OL,6,FModel Naomi Campbell has won her appeal
OL,7,Fagainst a ban on being a charity
OL,8,Ftrustee, after a tribunal ruled that
OL,9,Fshe was unaware of misconduct at her
OL,10,Fcharity Fashion for Relief.
OL,12,FCampbell was banned from being a
OL,13,Fcharity trustee for five years in 2024
OL,14,Fafter a watchdog found that Fashion for
OL,15,FRelief funds had been spent on luxury
OL,16,Fhotels and spa treatments.
OL,18,FHowever, a tribunal said on Thursday
OL,19,Fthat the most serious instances of
OL,20,Fmisconduct in the charity "were
OL,21,Fconcealed" from Campbell by a fellow
OL,22,Ftrustee.
OL,23,APub: 01-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG11/18
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,163,160,200,105,0,100
